Thus overall plan steps:

1. Prepare origin_availability_alpha (confirm_candidate_preparedness)
2. Attach task profile to origin_availability_alpha (attach_task_profile)
3. Activate origin node (activate_origin_node)
4. Assign operator to origin (assign_operator_resource)
5. Lock origin availability (lock_origin_availability) -> sets locked and confirmed
6. Load origin payload (load_origin_payload) -> sets origin_node_occupied true, origin_availability_locked true (still true), cargo unavailable, origin_payload_linked true
7. Unload origin payload (unload_origin_payload) -> sets origin_node_ready true (still), origin_availability_confirmed true, cargo available, removes origin_payload_linked, leaves origin_availability_locked true (unchanged)
